02:02:09,580 --> 02:02:10,560
Police like another camera.

2274
02:02:11,840 --> 02:02:12,400
Uh, main entrance.

2275
02:02:13,580 --> 02:02:14,940
Yo, that's sick!

2276
02:02:19,240 --> 02:02:20,140
Sewer entry.

2277
02:02:22,720 --> 02:02:23,320
Lobby.

2278
02:02:25,240 --> 02:02:25,840
Dope.

2279
02:02:27,740 --> 02:02:28,340
Containment.

2280
02:02:31,000 --> 02:02:31,720
Oh, man.

2281
02:02:32,120 --> 02:02:32,960
Stuart, I'm sorry.

2282
02:02:34,060 --> 02:02:34,400
Parler.

2283
02:02:34,820 --> 02:02:35,400
At the same time.

2284
02:02:35,560 --> 02:02:36,100
Or can you?

2285
02:02:36,300 --> 02:02:36,920
Maybe you can.

2286
02:02:37,100 --> 02:02:38,260
Which would make this one false.

2287
02:02:38,580 --> 02:02:39,420
Oh, but wait a minute!

2288
02:02:39,640 --> 02:02:39,960
Ha ha!

2289
02:02:40,120 --> 02:02:41,740
We're dealing with three gems today.

2290
02:02:41,940 --> 02:02:43,500
We no longer have two, right?

2291
02:02:43,640 --> 02:02:46,320
If that was the case, it would obviously be in the blue, because it's true.

2292
02:02:46,480 --> 02:02:49,480
But because we have three, it has to be in the black, right?

2293
02:02:49,660 --> 02:02:50,500
But let's just double check.

2294
02:02:50,720 --> 02:02:53,540
So, white is right, blue is true, black is whack.

2295
02:02:53,660 --> 02:02:55,240
But not today, because there's three gems.

2296
02:02:55,460 --> 02:02:56,500
It has to be in the black.

2297
02:02:56,900 --> 02:02:57,260
Right?

2298
02:02:57,260 --> 02:02:58,580
I can't see any other way.

2299
02:02:58,760 --> 02:02:59,460
It's gotta be.

2300
02:03:09,130 --> 02:03:09,790
Amazing!

2301
02:03:10,590 --> 02:03:11,850
That is amazing!

2302
02:03:12,990 --> 02:03:13,650
Wow!

2303
02:03:18,050 --> 02:03:19,330
Aw, Stuart!

2304
02:03:20,250 --> 02:03:20,850
Shit!

2305
02:03:21,890 --> 02:03:22,610
Hold on!

2306
02:03:23,950 --> 02:03:24,470
What's this?

2307
02:03:25,310 --> 02:03:26,950
Gate can only be toggled with the security.

2308
02:03:27,150 --> 02:03:27,930
HG's permission.

2309
02:03:28,090 --> 02:03:28,370
Headguard.

2310
02:03:29,010 --> 02:03:30,210
Torture machine access.

2311
02:03:30,330 --> 02:03:31,170
We gotta turn that off!

2312
02:03:31,330 --> 02:03:31,650
Stat!

2313
02:03:33,510 --> 02:03:35,650
We can't waste a second here.

2314
02:03:37,930 --> 02:03:38,950
Get rid of this.

2315
02:03:39,890 --> 02:03:41,150
Retinal scanner broken right now.

2316
02:03:41,310 --> 02:03:41,850
Sorry, guys.

2317
02:03:42,230 --> 02:03:42,810
Fuck you, Willy.

2318
02:03:44,250 --> 02:03:45,550
Retinal authentication required.

2319
02:03:45,950 --> 02:03:47,170
So, let me just try anyway.

2320
02:03:49,430 --> 02:03:50,410
Stick it in there!

2321
02:03:54,390 --> 02:03:54,950
Damn!

2322
02:03:54,950 --> 02:03:56,190
Can I not break this?

2323
02:04:01,980 --> 02:04:02,740
Wait a minute.

2324
02:04:06,100 --> 02:04:06,680
Okay.

2325
02:04:08,100 --> 02:04:08,920
Let's go.

2326
02:04:09,860 --> 02:04:11,260
I'm gonna charge this.

2327
02:04:12,620 --> 02:04:14,020
Nice.

2328
02:04:17,880 --> 02:04:19,680
Now we go...

2329
02:04:19,680 --> 02:04:20,820
This way?

2330
02:04:26,130 --> 02:04:27,590
All the way back here.

2331
02:04:33,580 --> 02:04:34,300
Yes!

2332
02:04:36,640 --> 02:04:39,040
Dear employee, do not release Stuart!

2333
02:04:39,560 --> 02:04:41,420
The Stuart in this cage is the original.

2334
02:04:41,740 --> 02:04:42,680
The real Stuart.

2335
02:04:43,320 --> 02:04:46,800
At any time, he may be needed to jumpstart the cloning process again, so keep him in there.

2336
02:04:47,400 --> 02:04:50,580
Other than that, feel free to join him watching his clones get tortured.

2337
02:04:50,900 --> 02:04:51,180
Jesus.

2338
02:04:51,180 --> 02:04:55,040
Signed, Oliver David, CEO of Engrave Corporation.

2339
02:04:55,260 --> 02:04:55,660
No!

2340
02:04:58,790 --> 02:04:59,970
Get out of there!

2341
02:05:00,550 --> 02:05:01,770
You're free, Stuart!

2342
02:05:02,570 --> 02:05:03,650
Is it you?

2343
02:05:04,370 --> 02:05:05,450
It is.

2344
02:05:05,750 --> 02:05:06,830
You freed me!

2345
02:05:08,050 --> 02:05:10,310
Oh my god, I thought I'd never get out of here.

2346
02:05:12,130 --> 02:05:12,430
Yeah.

2347
02:05:13,390 --> 02:05:14,350
Let's go home.

2348
02:05:16,510 --> 02:05:17,550
Damn right, Stuart.

2349
02:05:17,770 --> 02:05:18,270
Damn right.

2350
02:05:18,590 --> 02:05:19,090
Let's go.

2351
02:05:19,930 --> 02:05:20,610
Follow me.

2352
02:05:20,850 --> 02:05:22,390
I'm so sorry for everything.

2353
02:05:23,030 --> 02:05:24,010
It wasn't me.

2354
02:05:24,150 --> 02:05:24,410
It wasn't me.

2355
02:05:24,410 --> 02:05:24,930
It was my clone.

2356
02:05:25,590 --> 02:05:26,050
Okay?

2357
02:05:26,210 --> 02:05:26,850
I didn't do it.

2358
02:05:28,750 --> 02:05:29,570
It wasn't me.

2359
02:05:31,850 --> 02:05:33,890
I can barely believe it's really you.

2360
02:05:34,570 --> 02:05:35,310
I know.

2361
02:05:36,730 --> 02:05:40,050
Or at least, I hope you are the real you.

2362
02:05:41,850 --> 02:05:43,950
Do you have any idea of what he's done to me?

2363
02:05:46,740 --> 02:05:48,080
What he did to my clones?

2364
02:05:50,640 --> 02:05:51,100
Oliver.

2365
02:05:52,600 --> 02:05:53,300
Oliver.

2366
02:05:53,300 --> 02:05:54,640
Please never leave me alone again.

2367
02:05:55,800 --> 02:05:56,500
Please.

2368
02:06:00,680 --> 02:06:01,720
I won't.

2369
02:06:03,740 --> 02:06:04,440
Please.

2370
02:06:12,650 --> 02:06:13,540
Looking in the mirror.

2371
02:06:24,970 --> 02:06:25,960
Oliver and Stuart.

2372
02:06:27,030 --> 02:06:28,100
What a surprise.

2373
02:06:29,180 --> 02:06:33,040
I must say, I'm quite impressed you managed to find me here.

2374
02:06:33,600 --> 02:06:34,080
Oliver.

2375
02:06:35,080 --> 02:06:39,460
After I took Stuart from you, I considered killing you right then and there in your bed.

2376
02:06:39,600 --> 02:06:40,540
But I didn't.

2377
02:06:41,900 --> 02:06:44,420
I have never guessed you'd figure out my plan.

2378
02:06:45,520 --> 02:06:46,000
Oliver.

2379
02:06:46,580 --> 02:06:46,840
Oliver.

2380
02:06:46,840 --> 02:06:48,920
Or should I say, our plan.

2381
02:06:49,300 --> 02:06:49,320
Oliver.

2382
02:06:49,740 --> 02:06:50,380
Oliver.

2383
02:06:50,440 --> 02:06:50,680
Oliver.

2384
02:06:51,480 --> 02:06:51,620
Oliver.

2385
02:06:51,620 --> 02:06:53,340
I wasn't sure what to do with you for a while.

2386
02:06:55,560 --> 02:06:58,500
But then one day, I figured it out.

2387
02:06:59,640 --> 02:07:02,020
You were the key to getting Stuart to come to the island.

2388
02:07:02,440 --> 02:07:03,900
The ultimate bait.

2389
02:07:05,600 --> 02:07:09,700
A good friend that had won a prize, who wouldn't want to celebrate with them.

2390
02:07:11,800 --> 02:07:18,560
With your memories of this place wiped, I sent you back to our apartment in Denmark, ready to lure you here when the machines were finished.

2391
02:07:20,640 --> 02:07:23,480
And now, my plan is unfolding flawlessly.

2392
02:07:24,900 --> 02:07:29,420
Since you arrived last week, I've cloned Stuart hundreds, if not thousands of times.

2393
02:07:30,740 --> 02:07:33,040
Only one of them has to give me the recipe.

2394
02:07:34,700 --> 02:07:35,640
Only one!

2395
02:07:40,330 --> 02:07:40,890
Boss!

2396
02:07:41,250 --> 02:07:43,270
A guy's been spotted running around the building!

2397
02:07:43,570 --> 02:07:44,990
He's been killing all...

2398
02:07:45,630 --> 02:07:47,070
Wait a minute...

2399
02:07:48,190 --> 02:07:49,110
Another boss?

2400
02:07:49,930 --> 02:07:50,490
Stuart?

2401
02:07:53,680 --> 02:07:54,600
Yeah, okay.

2402
02:07:54,900 --> 02:07:55,260
Never mind.

2403
02:07:59,620 --> 02:08:00,280
Ahem!

2404
02:08:00,520 --> 02:08:01,280
Where were we?

2405
02:08:02,240 --> 02:08:02,900
Right!

2406
02:08:03,260 --> 02:08:03,980
My plan!

2407
02:08:05,100 --> 02:08:07,920
You will not be able to stop me now, Oliver.

2408
02:08:09,080 --> 02:08:12,880
The recipe for the invisibility potion will be mine.

2409
02:08:13,820 --> 02:08:14,240
Mine!

2410
02:08:17,480 --> 02:08:20,520
And Stuart, I hope you're proud of what you forced me to do.

2411
02:08:21,660 --> 02:08:22,540
Yeah, buh, buh, buh, buh.

2412
02:08:22,540 --> 02:08:27,120
I hope you will regret not giving me the recipe for the rest of your miserable little life.

2413
02:08:28,520 --> 02:08:31,640
And just so you know, I slept with your wife!

2414
02:08:32,800 --> 02:08:33,660
Many times!

2415
02:08:35,680 --> 02:08:37,020
Oh, yeah!

2416
02:08:37,520 --> 02:08:39,220
That nose of hers can do some crazy stuff!

2417
02:08:39,680 --> 02:08:40,600
Let me tell you that.

2418
02:08:41,660 --> 02:08:46,680
Now, excuse me, as I still have some business to attend to in my secret volcano hideout.

2419
02:08:48,100 --> 02:08:49,120
Farewell, friends!

2420
02:09:10,380 --> 02:09:11,720
He flew into the volcano!

2421
02:09:18,560 --> 02:09:19,820
Go beat that bastard!

2422
02:09:19,940 --> 02:09:20,920
I'll follow my way out!

2423
02:09:23,560 --> 02:09:23,920
But...

2424
02:09:23,920 --> 02:09:26,060
Didn't you ask me to never leave you alone again?

2425
02:09:27,380 --> 02:09:28,580
I have some clones to free.

2426
02:09:28,700 --> 02:09:29,320
I can handle it.

2427
02:09:29,480 --> 02:09:30,720
Don't worry, but you'll need this.

2428
02:09:32,900 --> 02:09:33,340
Oh...

2429
02:09:33,340 --> 02:09:34,060
Thanks, man!

2430
02:09:34,320 --> 02:09:36,140
I can never ask for a better friend than you.

2431
02:09:37,880 --> 02:09:39,080
Stuart, you're the real one!

2432
02:09:43,660 --> 02:09:44,980
I'm gonna consume this potion.

2433
02:09:45,080 --> 02:09:45,520
Hold on a minute.

2434
02:09:46,940 --> 02:09:47,980
Damn, that's purple.

2435
02:09:49,800 --> 02:09:51,780
My plan by Oliver David.

2436
02:09:52,400 --> 02:09:54,100
It's been seven years...

2437
02:09:54,560 --> 02:09:59,560
Seven years since I started playing this damn game, and I still don't know how to make that stupid invisibility potion.

2438
02:09:59,960 --> 02:10:01,240
How is this possible?

2439
02:10:01,240 --> 02:10:03,620
I know everything else there is to know.

2440
02:10:03,840 --> 02:10:06,140
I've mastered the art of mining and crafting.

2441
02:10:06,400 --> 02:10:10,020
I've become an enchantment master and built the most incredible creations.

2442
02:10:10,520 --> 02:10:13,840
And with my redstone knowledge, I've powered my beautiful machine.

2443
02:10:14,820 --> 02:10:19,280
I've even finally figured out how to clone living organisms after only a few failed attempts.

2444
02:10:19,960 --> 02:10:21,500
I have everything I'd ever want.

2445
02:10:21,900 --> 02:10:24,240
Everything, except for that stupid potion.

2446
02:10:24,780 --> 02:10:27,000
So, I have devised a plan.

2447
02:10:28,000 --> 02:10:28,600
Stuart!

2448
02:10:29,140 --> 02:10:30,260
He knows the recipe.

2449
02:10:30,400 --> 02:10:31,760
He trades me the potion all the time.

2450
02:10:32,040 --> 02:10:33,640
But he won't tell me how he makes it.

2451
02:10:33,720 --> 02:10:34,260
He's selfish.

2452
02:10:34,760 --> 02:10:37,220
I need to take it from him, to force him to speak.

2453
02:10:37,220 --> 02:10:38,200
I think I know how.

2454
02:10:38,700 --> 02:10:40,600
I will lure him here and give him an offer.

2455
02:10:41,120 --> 02:10:46,040
I will show him what my machine can do, and I will give him one final chance to speak on his own terms.

2456
02:10:46,540 --> 02:10:49,240
If he does, our friendship will prove true.

2457
02:10:49,240 --> 02:10:53,060
And we will bathe in my all-encompassing wisdom for the rest of time.

2458
02:10:53,440 --> 02:10:53,960
Together.

2459
02:10:55,100 --> 02:10:59,500
But if he doesn't, I will extract the information from him in three steps.

2460
02:11:00,160 --> 02:11:00,780
Step one.

2461
02:11:01,340 --> 02:11:01,860
Interrogation.

2462
02:11:02,080 --> 02:11:03,980
I will trap Stuart and interrogate him.

2463
02:11:04,220 --> 02:11:06,780
My machine can do things he had never thought were possible.

2464
02:11:07,300 --> 02:11:09,320
And it will for sure make him speak.

2465
02:11:09,920 --> 02:11:12,300
And if he doesn't speak, even after all that?

2466
02:11:12,720 --> 02:11:14,860
Well, I can't risk losing Stuart, of course.

2467
02:11:15,140 --> 02:11:17,420
He's my only chance of ever knowing the recipe.

2468
02:11:17,780 --> 02:11:19,740
I need to keep him alive for this to work.

2469
02:11:20,200 --> 02:11:21,800
That's where step two comes in.

2470
02:11:22,620 --> 02:11:23,360
Step two.

2471
02:11:23,540 --> 02:11:23,880
Cloning.

2472
02:11:24,240 --> 02:11:27,560
I will clone Stuart using the machine's newest functionalities.

2473
02:11:27,940 --> 02:11:30,580
I will clone him as many times as is needed.

2474
02:11:30,920 --> 02:11:34,040
With each and every clone going through step one of the process.

2475
02:11:34,740 --> 02:11:36,260
Eventually, one of them has to speak.

2476
02:11:36,900 --> 02:11:38,280
But what if none of them do?

2477
02:11:38,280 --> 02:11:40,940
Could it be that Stuart is that stoic and smart?

2478
02:11:41,500 --> 02:11:44,720
Even if, out of an infinite number of Stuarts, none...

2479
02:11:44,720 --> 02:11:47,060
Not one of them speaks, I can still get the recipe.

2480
02:11:47,780 --> 02:11:49,700
The last step of the plan has to work.

2481
02:11:49,700 --> 02:11:50,440
I'm sure of it.

2482
02:11:51,140 --> 02:11:51,740
Step three.

2483
02:11:51,880 --> 02:11:52,300
Brewing.

2484
02:11:52,540 --> 02:11:57,980
If the missing brewing ingredient isn't stored in Stuart's brain, it must be stored elsewhere in his body.

2485
02:11:58,300 --> 02:12:01,580
I will take the remains of Stuart's clones and separate his different parts.

2486
02:12:02,040 --> 02:12:05,360
Maybe it's his feet, or his eyes, or his huge nose.

2487
02:12:05,980 --> 02:12:08,900
I will try every single part of his body in my brewing stand.

2488
02:12:09,260 --> 02:12:11,100
I will try combinations of parts.

2489
02:12:11,260 --> 02:12:12,040
I will try everything.

2490
02:12:12,740 --> 02:12:14,660
Maybe it requires ten steward gnosis.

2491
02:12:14,980 --> 02:12:16,540
Maybe four feet and three arms.

2492
02:12:16,900 --> 02:12:18,340
Maybe his liver is important.

2493
02:12:18,720 --> 02:12:20,140
I will figure it out.

2494
02:12:20,640 --> 02:12:22,620
And then, one day, I will have it.

2495
02:12:22,840 --> 02:12:25,860
I will know the brewing recipe of the potion of invisibility.

2496
02:12:26,420 --> 02:12:30,400
And with that, I will know everything one could possibly know about Minecraft.

2497
02:12:30,400 --> 02:12:34,440
I will truly be the best Minecraft player of all time.

2498
02:12:36,120 --> 02:12:37,400
That is my plan.

2499
02:12:38,240 --> 02:12:40,100
It's honestly a genius plan.

2500
02:12:40,360 --> 02:12:42,280
The first full adventuring gear.

2501
02:12:42,960 --> 02:12:43,520
I

2502
02:12:49,140 --> 02:12:50,640
have a confession to make.

2503
02:12:51,100 --> 02:12:52,760
Something that I'm proud of.

2504
02:12:53,080 --> 02:12:54,800
Something that happened recently.

2505
02:12:55,320 --> 02:12:58,280
Something that I just can't get out of my mind.

2506
02:12:58,760 --> 02:13:02,320
And it's time to finally let it all out.

2507
02:13:03,240 --> 02:13:08,820
Now, before I tell you what happened, I need to preface this by saying that.

2508
02:13:09,100 --> 02:13:10,320
I will do this again.

2509
02:13:10,860 --> 02:13:14,060
In fact, what happened needs some background.

2510
02:13:15,000 --> 02:13:20,760
Because what happened is completely ridiculous and out of my control.

2511
02:13:21,240 --> 02:13:24,860
To understand what happened, we need to start at the beginning.

2512
02:13:25,620 --> 02:13:30,580
Now, a couple of weeks ago, I was hanging out, like you usually do.

2513
02:13:31,040 --> 02:13:33,860
Just goofing around a bit, having thoughts.

2514
02:13:34,540 --> 02:13:38,260
Thinking about the world and what is actually going on out there.

2515
02:13:38,520 --> 02:13:41,060
But in the water, I saw my own reflection.

2516
02:13:41,520 --> 02:13:45,280
And it made me think, what if there's more to all this?

2517
02:13:45,280 --> 02:13:52,540
What if life is not all about video games, potatoes, black holes, potatoes, potatoes.

2518
02:13:53,440 --> 02:13:55,080
Maybe there's something else.

2519
02:13:56,020 --> 02:13:58,560
So I decided to do the logical thing here.

2520
02:13:58,700 --> 02:14:01,120
And you're not gonna believe what I found.

2521
02:14:01,420 --> 02:14:04,880
I have discovered, maybe, the most incredible thing ever.

2522
02:14:05,480 --> 02:14:08,600
But the problem is, it would cost me everything.

2523
02:14:09,180 --> 02:14:11,300
And I paid it, gladly.

2524
02:14:12,200 --> 02:14:15,980
When you find out what exactly it is, I think you'll agree.

2525
02:14:16,520 --> 02:14:17,840
You would do the same.

2526
02:14:18,440 --> 02:14:21,060
The issue was, though, I didn't know where to start.

2527
02:14:21,180 --> 02:14:23,020
But I was in search of more.

2528
02:14:23,320 --> 02:14:27,400
And the thing that came out of it, you are not gonna believe it.

2529
02:14:27,420 --> 02:14:29,020
It's gonna blow your mind.

2530
02:14:29,200 --> 02:14:36,400
Because this story right here, you can't even begin to understand the significance and the depth of my situation.

2531
02:14:37,320 --> 02:14:39,520
Now, it started like any other day.

2532
02:14:39,520 --> 02:14:40,040
Oh my god.

2533
02:14:40,800 --> 02:14:42,900
Get to it already, Oliver!

2534
02:14:43,340 --> 02:14:44,120
And I saw it.

2535
02:14:44,300 --> 02:14:46,440
It was right there in front of me.

2536
